{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":38,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["希西迦患病"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那些日子，希西迦病危，亞摩斯的兒子以賽亞先知前來對他說：「耶和華說，『你要交待後事，因為你要死了，你必無法康復。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["希西迦把臉轉向牆，向耶和華禱告，說："]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["「耶和華啊，求你顧念我怎樣全心、忠誠地事奉你，做你視為善的事。」希西迦痛哭起來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和華對以賽亞說："]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["「你去告訴希西迦，『你祖先大衛的上帝耶和華說，我垂聽了你的禱告，也看見了你的眼淚，我要使你的壽命增加十五年。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我要從亞述王手中拯救你和這城，我要保護這城。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["以賽亞說：「拿一塊無花果餅貼在王的瘡上，他就會痊癒。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["希西迦問：「有什麼兆頭證明我會上耶和華的殿呢？」",{"noteId":18}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["以賽亞說：「耶和華要給你一個預兆，以證明祂言出必行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["祂要使亞哈斯日晷上的日影後退十度。」果然，日影後退了十度。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["猶大王希西迦病癒後，",{"text":"寫了一首詩：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我以為自己盛年之際，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就要踏入陰間之門，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能享受餘年。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我以為再也見不到耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在世間再不能見到祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不能再見到世人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的居所像牧人的帳篷一樣被拆走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我像織布的捲布一樣捲起自己的生命，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂從織布機上把我剪斷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"旦夕之間，祂使我的生命戛然而止。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我整夜哀號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂像獅子一樣咬斷我全身的骨頭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"旦夕之間，祂使我的生命戛然而止。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"「我像燕、鶴一樣哀鳴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像鴿子一樣呻吟；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我舉目望天，雙眼疲倦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我困苦不堪，求你保護我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我能說什麼呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂對我說的，祂都親自成就了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為心靈的苦痛，我要一生謹慎行事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"「主啊，你的法令使人存活，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我的心靈存活。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，求你使我身體復原，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓我存活。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其實我受大苦對我有益。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你施慈愛，從死亡的深坑中拯救我的生命，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將我一切罪惡拋在你背後。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誠然，陰間不會稱謝你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"死亡不會讚美你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"下墳墓的人不會仰望你的信實。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只有活著的人會像我今天這樣稱謝你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"父親會把你的信實告訴子女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"「耶和華必救我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們要一生一世在祂殿中彈琴歌唱。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":18,"caller":"+","text":"這兩節在原文抄本是放在本章末尾，不過這可能是在謄抄過程中放錯位置。其實這兩節經文放在6節和7節之間最為自然，就如在列王紀下一樣，參見列王紀下20·7‑8。","reference":{"chapter":38,"verse":22}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/38.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/39.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/37.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}